<title>USA: Faroudja Inc files IPO.</title>
<headline>Faroudja Inc files IPO.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Faroudja Inc filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on Wednesday for an initial public stock offering to raise $34.5 million.</p>
<p>The Sunnyvale, Calif.-based video equipment maker did not disclose how many shares it planned to offer.</p>
<p>It said net proceeds will be used for research and development and general corporate purposes, including working capital.</p>
<p>The company has applied for the stock symbol &quot;FDJA&quot; on the Nasdaq stock exchange.</p>
<p>The underwriters are Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co and Volpe Brown Whelan &amp; Co.</p>
